ex['guided-safe-action']['observablePerformanceEn']='After specific teacher release safely executes the prescribed steps of the selected guided route, controls its stated variables, and records actual action, deviations and stops. Ordinary age-appropriate cases may investigate conductivity or dissolution; the BW upper-secondary variant uses both complete bromine cases.'
